**New first rung (gh-994): pure head-change reset.** When label present, `parkedHeadVf` (park-comment sha) known, `uHead` known, and `uHead !== parkedHeadVf` → remove label unconditionally, log `park-reset: <key> head <old>→<new>`, set unparkedThisPass = true. No actor probe, no park-time probe, no verdict probe.

