Now: should the unconditional reset still post a comment? Ticket Q2 default: machine-log line only, no PR comment for automated housekeeping. I4: "no comment edit needed (the contract was right, the code was wrong)". I'll log `park-reset: <key> head <old>→<new>` via console.log and NOT post a comment for this rung. Keep existing comments for other rungs.

